{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_855.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"7a307208146bdf89d446da913986b2a19d48a20f6aeca1e0aa024ddf606007ee","ja":"愛しの君は困惑の中に","zh":"心爱的你身陷困惑之中","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_855.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"8170cc9b65033942912531726e49279118100b2e10ff02e57601c19099b375da","ja":"「僕に迫られるなんて、光栄だろう？　さあ\n覚悟を決めて。もっとドキドキさせてみせるからさ」","zh":"被我步步逼近，感到荣幸吧？来吧，做好觉悟。我会让你更加心跳不已的。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_855.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"bca99a61663e72725585ff1cd4fe76f5eb90f776b030f24a9f3b8bdf0f134d28","ja":"「ふふん、こんな色男に囲まれてるんだ。\nちょっとは素直になったらどうだい？」","zh":"“哼哼，你可是被这么多帅哥围着呢。稍微坦率一点怎么样？”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_855.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"7c641e22a699301cb175280af5430e6c8860e131d0366ef5abcd33ab65e1d5b5","ja":"……。\nふたりとも、もしかしてからかってませんか……？","zh":"……。\n你们两个，该不会是在逗我吧……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_855.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"df702bf1c3b2bc3fea293b9821dbe986a0eef7312ad7fed923fffcc447d0f083","ja":"「君が、からかいがいのある女の子ってことには、\n同意するよ。おかげで目が離せなくって……」","zh":"“我同意，你是个很值得逗弄的女孩。多亏了你，我才一直移不开视线……”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_855.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"10b263c7c23e4b3794c802f17f497c76bd51fa86dc8bebd782f800c3d2fcf012","ja":"「あっ、お兄様！\nアシュリーが逃げました！」","zh":"啊，哥哥大人！  \n阿什莉逃走了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_855.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"5bc3ccdebe1e05bb8a7bbbbddb1ca0b255307998a05ba2c453d7a0ee925e149e","ja":"「まったく、おてんばだな……。\n追いかけよう！」","zh":"真是的，太调皮了……\n追上去吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_855.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"f5276f6ee33e6f9e17799dd4d8a1daccc15112107b74f7640b122296df9bb767","ja":"はあ……悪ふざけには付き合えないわ。\nでも、すぐに追いかけてきそう……。","zh":"唉……我可没空陪你胡闹。\n不过，她好像马上就要追上来了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_855.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"015a7d46e8ac3a29bc856cbd63be799f4fe9055cba35cc42e1c67d7635771b83","ja":"あれ、志保ちゃん。少し表情が暗いみたいだけど、\nもしかして、なにか悩み事？","zh":"咦，志保。你的表情好像有点阴沉，难道是有什么烦恼吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
